WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.919
The website is done.

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:07.409
The agent ran its tests and the build,
deployed the site to Azure Static

00:00:07.409 --> 00:00:12.507
Web Apps, and then opened the live
site in the app's browser panel.

00:00:12.507 --> 00:00:17.605
It even checked its own work in
the browser and fixed two layout

00:00:17.605 --> 00:00:19.174
problems before it deployed.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:23.846
Here's the map.

00:00:23.846 --> 00:00:28.552
When I press play, it animates home
price changes for every quarter

00:00:28.552 --> 00:00:30.513
since the year two thousand.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:39.500
I can open any state, like Texas, to
see its price trend compared with

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.598
the U.S., and its mortgage loans
by purpose from 2018 to 2025.

00:00:44.598 --> 00:00:50.088
Below the map are the fifteen metro
areas with the largest change in the

00:00:50.088 --> 00:00:50.873
last year.
